        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository c90c8b30-19cd-4c87-a185-f40d235243e0).Image",
        "Description": "A contract has been issued, and you have been cleared to engage. All targets were involved in the brutal murder of the client&apos;s daughter six months ago, but her death was ruled accidental and the case was closed. Her remains were found in a dumpster in an alley in Marrakesh and the client has requested that you &quot;set the stage&quot; in that location. Good luck, 47.",
